nnect promotion to a value from your brand voice, e.g., \\\"everyone deserves a little luxury,\\\" \\\"making smart choices should be easy,\\\" etc.]. That's why we're offering {{$json.description}}.\\n\\nIt’s our way of saying thank you to our amazing community! Tag a friend who needs to see this and head to the link in our bio to learn more.\\n\\n#{{$json.name}} #{{$json.title}} #NewOffer #CommunityLove #[BrandHashtag]\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":418,\"promptTokens\":41,\"totalTokens\":459}}}"}}
