e\\n\\n***\\n\\n### **Option 3: LinkedIn (Professional & Value-focused)**\\n\\nWe are pleased to announce a new opportunity for our valued customers and community: **{{$json.title}}**.\\n\\nWith this special promotion, you can now {{$json.description}}. This is an excellent chance to [mention a professional benefit, e.g., \\\"enhance your skills,\\\" \\\"improve your workflow,\\\" or \\\"invest in quality solutions\\\"].\\n\\nWe believe in providing exceptional value, and this offer is a reflection of our commitment to your success.\\n\\nLearn more and take advantage of this limited-time offer by visiting our website: [Link to your website/promotion]\\n\\n#{{$json.name}} #{{$json.title.replace(' ', '')}} #Business #Promotion #Offer\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":480,\"promptTokens\":41,\"totalTokens\":521}}}"}}
